^ JTAG             | [[docs:techref:hardware:port.jtag.cables|Yes]]                           |

==== Serial ====
Can be accessed by removing the metal cover which is secured by four T6H screws.  Connect on Console (J2). P1 is closest to the H1 screw, and P4 is closest to the JTAG port.

| **P1:** VCC   |
| **P2:** RX    |
| **P3:** TX    |
| **P4:** GND   |

^ Serial connection parameters\\ for Meraki MX60 | 115200, 8N1 |

